VS Code shows a packed CHANGELOG.md as the extension's 變更記錄 tab, so
whoever installs a new .vsix sees what it adds. One short entry per version
from 0.35 on, the earlier ones in a few lines. README links it; pack.ps1
packs it.

Test: smoke (packed, and its newest entry is this package's version -- a
round that forgets to write its entry fails there).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
